  "chapters": [
    {
      "id": "lab",
      "title": {
        "zh": "走进化学实验室",
        "en": "Inside the Lab"
      },
      "format": "markdown",
      "content": "\n化学从“观察”开始，而不是从“背结论”开始。\n\n| 仪器 | 用途 | 注意 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 试管 | 少量反应 | 加热时管口不对人 |\n| 量筒 | 量取液体 | 读数视线与凹液面最低处齐平 |\n| 酒精灯 | 加热 | 用外焰，不用嘴吹灭 |\n\n> 实验台上的规则不是装饰：闻气体要用手轻轻扇动，不能把鼻子凑到瓶口。\n",
      "content_en": "\nChemistry starts with observation, not memorised conclusions.\n\n| Apparatus | Use | Care |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Test tube | Small reactions | Point away from people when heating |\n| Measuring cylinder | Measure liquid | Read at the bottom of the meniscus |\n| Alcohol lamp | Heat | Use the outer flame; never blow it out |\n\n> Lab rules are not decoration: waft a gas toward your nose, never put your nose over the mouth of a bottle.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "particles",
      "title": {
        "zh": "分子、原子与元素",
        "en": "Particles and Elements"
      },
      "format": "markdown",
      "content": "\n物质由分子、原子等微观粒子构成。一滴水里有大约 $1.7 \\times 10^{21}$ 个水分子。\n\n| 粒子 | 特征 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 分子 | 保持物质化学性质的最小粒子 |\n| 原子 | 化学变化中的最小粒子 |\n| 离子 | 带电的原子或原子团 |\n\n```mdxb-html\n{\"title\": \"把一滴水放大\", \"height\": 380, \"source\": \"<!doctype html><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"><style>\\nhtml,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:#f7f2e8;font-family:system-ui;overflow:hidden}\\ncanvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}\\np{position:absolute;left:16px;bottom:12px;margin:0;color:#6c5c49;font-size:12px}\\n</style><canvas></canvas><p>点击画布，给粒子一点扰动</p><script>\\nconst c=document.querySelector('canvas'),x=c.getContext('2d');let d=[],w,h;\\nfunction fit(){w=c.width=c.clientWidth*devicePixelRatio;h=c.height=c.clientHeight*devicePixelRatio;x.setTransform(devicePixelRatio,0,0,devicePixelRatio,0,0);}\\nfunction seed(){d=[];for(let i=0;i<70;i++)d.push({x:Math.random()*innerWidth,y:Math.random()*innerHeight,vx:(Math.random()-.5)*.5,vy:(Math.random()-.5)*.5,r:2+Math.random()*3});}\\naddEventListener('resize',()=>{fit();seed();});fit();seed();requestAnimationFrame(()=>{fit();seed();});\\nc.onclick=()=>d.forEach(p=>{p.vx+=(Math.random()-.5)*2;p.vy+=(Math.random()-.5)*2;});\\n(function loop(){if(!c.width)fit();x.clearRect(0,0,innerWidth,innerHeight);for(const p of d){p.x+=p.vx;p.y+=p.vy;if(p.x<0||p.x>innerWidth)p.vx*=-1;if(p.y<0||p.y>innerHeight)p.vy*=-1;x.beginPath();x.arc(p.x,p.y,p.r,0,7);x.fillStyle='#b05226';x.fill();}requestAnimationFrame(loop);})();\\n</script>\"}\n```\n\n粒子在不停运动，温度越高，运动越剧烈。这就是“扩散”的微观解释。\n",
      "content_en": "\nMatter is made of molecules, atoms and ions. One drop of water holds about $1.7 × 10^21$ water molecules.\n\n| Particle | What it is |\n| --- | --- |\n| Molecule | Smallest particle that keeps the chemical properties |\n| Atom | Smallest particle in a chemical change |\n| Ion | A charged atom or group of atoms |\n\nClick the canvas to disturb the particles. They move constantly; the hotter the substance, the faster they move. That is diffusion at the particle level.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "equations",
      "title": {
        "zh": "化学方程式",
        "en": "Chemical Equations"
      },
      "format": "markdown",
      "content": "\n化学方程式用符号记录反应，两边每一种原子的数目必须相等。\n\n| 反应 | 方程式 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 木炭燃烧 | $C + O_2 \\rightarrow CO_2$ |\n| 氢气燃烧 | $2H_2 + O_2 \\rightarrow 2H_2O$ |\n| 实验室制氧气 | $2KMnO_4 \\rightarrow K_2MnO_4 + MnO_2 + O_2\\uparrow$ |\n\n配平步骤：\n\n1. 写出反应物和生成物的化学式；\n2. 配平原子个数，先配复杂物质；\n3. 检查条件、气体和沉淀符号；\n4. 把箭头改成等号。\n\n- [x] 两边原子数相等\n- [x] 化学式没有改错\n- [ ] 标出反应条件\n",
      "content_en": "\nA chemical equation records a reaction with symbols. The number of each kind of atom must match on both sides.\n\n| Reaction | Equation |\n| --- | --- |\n| Burning charcoal | $C + O_2 \\rightarrow CO_2$ |\n| Burning hydrogen | $2H_2 + O_2 \\rightarrow 2H_2O$ |\n| Making oxygen | $2KMnO_4 \\rightarrow K_2MnO_4 + MnO_2 + O_2\\uparrow$ |\n\nBalance in four steps: write the formulas, balance atoms starting with the most complex substance, add conditions and state symbols, then replace the arrow with an equals sign.\n\n- [x] Atoms balance\n- [x] Formulas are unchanged\n- [ ] Conditions marked\n"
    }
  ],
